1
00:00:00,825 --> 00:00:04,325
OK. I need to speak to my boyfriend
in private, like, right now.

2
00:00:04,495 --> 00:00:07,475
(Howard:)There's a car with a glass roof.
Want to go look at the stars?

3
00:00:07,632 --> 00:00:11,012
(Bernadette:)-That sounds so romantic.
-Give it a rest!

4
00:00:12,303 --> 00:00:13,783
(Penny:)Let's go.

5
00:00:17,842 --> 00:00:20,452
(Amy:)-Why are you still here?
-Excuse me.

6
00:00:20,611 --> 00:00:22,321
(Sheldon:)I think you're being a little rude.

7
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:25,190
(Amy:)I'm being rude? You've been
rude to me this entire evening.

8
00:00:25,349 --> 00:00:26,919
(Sheldon:)How is that possible?

9
00:00:27,084 --> 00:00:30,194
(Sheldon:)I've hardly spoken
to you since we got on the train.

10
00:00:32,190 --> 00:00:34,360
(Man:)I'm detecting a little
friction between you two,

11
00:00:34,525 --> 00:00:36,665
(Man:)and I don't want to be a third rail.

12
00:00:37,528 --> 00:00:38,868
(Man:)Get it?

13
00:00:39,797 --> 00:00:41,037
(Sheldon:)I get it.

14
00:00:43,334 --> 00:00:44,714
Leave!

15
00:00:46,504 --> 00:00:49,214
(Sheldon:)-What is your problem?
-it's Valentine's Day.

16
00:00:49,373 --> 00:00:51,283
(Amy:)We're supposed to be
having a romantic weekend.

17
00:00:51,442 --> 00:00:53,942
(Sheldon:)Oh, really?
Because I remember you saying

18
00:00:54,111 --> 00:00:56,281
(Sheldon:)that this trip was going to be
something we could both enjoy.

19
00:00:56,447 --> 00:01:00,027
(Sheldon:)Did you mean that,
or were you just trying to trick me?

